# Managed by Terraform/Ansible (role: chrony)
#
# -x: never control the system clock. This container is an unprivileged LXC:
# it shares the PVE host clock and cannot adjust it (adjtimex is EPERM), so
# chronyd runs as a pure NTP server. The PVE host (chrony) keeps the clock
# correct; this container serves that time to the allowed networks.
DAEMON_OPTS="-F 1 -x"